    "title": "Exodus: Crypto Bitcoin Wallet",
    "description": "Own your crypto future with Exodus, the world's leading all-in-one crypto and bitcoin wallet.\r\n\r\nUnleash the possibilities\r\n\r\n\u2022 Send and receive crypto effortlessly: Simple transfers across 50+ networks\r\n\r\n\u2022 Manage your digital assets including Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, NFTs, and custom tokens\r\n\r\n\u2022 Import unlimited tokens on 16 web3 networks. Never wait for a wallet to add your token\r\n\r\n\u2022 Buy crypto with your bank card or Google Pay and have it deposited directly in your wallet\r\n\r\n\u2022 Sync Exodus across devices\r\n\r\n\u2022 World-class design: Designed by experts with experience at Apple, Microsoft, and more\r\n\r\n\r\nBeyond the basics\r\n\r\n\u2022 24/7 support: Our team is always here to help, day or night\r\n\r\n\u2022 Advanced features: real-time price charts, time-segmented balance display, price alerts, and more\r\n\r\n\u2022 Intuitive interface: Designed for ease of use, even for beginners\r\n\r\nJoin the crypto revolution with Exodus. Download now and experience the future of finance.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Own your crypto future with Exodus, the world&#39;s leading all-in-one crypto and bitcoin wallet.<br><br>Unleash the possibilities<br><br>\u2022 Send and receive crypto effortlessly: Simple transfers across 50+ networks<br><br>\u2022 Manage your digital assets including Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, NFTs, and custom tokens<br><br>\u2022 Import unlimited tokens on 16 web3 networks. Never wait for a wallet to add your token<br><br>\u2022 Buy crypto with your bank card or Google Pay and have it deposited directly in your wallet<br><br>\u2022 Sync Exodus across devices<br><br>\u2022 World-class design: Designed by experts with experience at Apple, Microsoft, and more<br><br><br>Beyond the basics<br><br>\u2022 24/7 support: Our team is always here to help, day or night<br><br>\u2022 Advanced features: real-time price charts, time-segmented balance display, price alerts, and more<br><br>\u2022 Intuitive interface: Designed for ease of use, even for beginners<br><br>Join the crypto revolution with Exodus. Download now and experience the future of finance.",
